IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DEC-BIN.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-DECIMAL    PIC 9(9).
01 WS-NUMERO     PIC 9(9).
01 WS-RESTO      PIC 9.
01 WS-BINARIO    PIC X(32).
01 WS-LEN        PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 WS-CHAR       PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Digite um numero decimal: "
    ACCEPT WS-DECIMAL

    IF WS-DECIMAL = 0
       DISPLAY "Binario: 0"
       STOP RUN
    END-IF

    MOVE WS-DECIMAL TO WS-NUMERO
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-NUMERO = 0
       COMPUTE WS-RESTO = FUNCTION MOD(WS-NUMERO, 2)
       COMPUTE WS-NUMERO = WS-NUMERO / 2
       STRING WS-BINARIO(1:WS-LEN) WS-RESTO
           DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-BINARIO
       ADD 1 TO WS-LEN
    END-PERFORM

    DISPLAY "Binario: " WS-BINARIO(1:WS-LEN)
    STOP RUN.
